From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zaid <nottzaid@tutamail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 03:57:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] miles-bench S17 dev: index cache mirrors GPU writes;
 PSO and allocation diagnostics

Index cache: CopyBufferRegion/CopyResource into the geometry heap copy
the same bytes into every live cached run (in the same command buffer)
instead of disabling the cache for the session; written pages stay out
of the cache until the allocator holding the copy is reset. Writers
that cannot be mirrored (UAVs, SO, clears, queries, WriteBufferImmediate,
placed footprints) exclude their range for good.

Diagnostics: VKD3D_BENCH_GPL_PROBE (library + fast link timing per PSO),
pso firstbind (create-to-first-bind gap of slow compiles), and the
requester of slow vkAllocateMemory calls.
